1. FREE USE - PERMITTED WITHOUT PRIOR PERMISSION

You may, without asking us and free of charge:

(a) allow search engines to crawl, index, and display the Data in search results, including in snippets and AI-generated answer panels that link back to this repository or to jiunotes.top;

(b) quote or reproduce a small excerpt of the Data - no more than 20 individual facts in total - in an article, report, or educational or reference material, provided that you credit "Jiu's Sharing Station", link to https://jiunotes.top, keep the official source link shown with each fact, and do not suggest that we endorse you or your work;

(c) use the Data for private study or non-commercial research.

2. USES THAT REQUIRE OUR WRITTEN PERMISSION

The following are not covered by the free use above and require our prior written permission:

(a) bulk download, scraping, or systematic retrieval of the Data;

(b) copying, mirroring, or redistributing all or a substantial part of the Data, whether on another website, under another domain, in an application, or in a dataset;

(c) any commercial use of the Data;

(d) including the Data in a product, service, or dataset made available to third parties;

(e) using the Data to train, fine-tune, or evaluate machine-learning or other AI models.

3. RESERVED RIGHTS

We reserve all rights not expressly granted in this license. The selection, arrangement, and descriptive wording of the Data are protected as a compilation. Individual facts are drawn from the official sources cited in each row, and those sources remain authoritative. Nothing in this license transfers ownership of the Data to you.

4. ATTRIBUTION

Where attribution is required, a reasonable form is: "Source: Jiu's Sharing Station (https://jiunotes.top), China travel facts database." You must also keep the official source link attached to each fact you use.

5. HOW TO ASK FOR PERMISSION

Open an issue in this repository, or email you@jiunotes.top (the same inbox as the contact page at https://jiunotes.top/contact). Tell us what you plan to do and how you will use the Data. We answer permission requests within two working days.

6. NO WARRANTY

The Data is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. We check each fact against an official source and record the date, but rules and fees change. Always confirm the current rule with the official source before relying on it.

